@startuml
[*] --> Logged_Out

Logged_Out : No active profile
Logged_Out --> Login : User logs in

Login : Authenticating user
Login --> Profile_Loaded : Profile loaded successfully

Profile_Loaded : Profile information displayed
Profile_Loaded --> View_Profile : View profile information
View_Profile --> Profile_Loaded : Return to profile view

Profile_Loaded --> Edit_Profile : Edit profile information
Edit_Profile : Editing profile information
Edit_Profile --> Save_Changes : Save changes
Save_Changes --> Profile_Loaded : Changes saved successfully

Edit_Profile --> Cancel_Edit : Cancel editing
Cancel_Edit --> Profile_Loaded : Editing canceled

Profile_Loaded --> Delete_Profile : Delete profile
Delete_Profile : Deleting profile
Delete_Profile --> Profile_Deleted : Profile deleted

Profile_Deleted : Profile information removed
Profile_Deleted --> [*] : System returns to logged out state

Profile_Loaded --> Logout : User logs out
Logout : Logging out
Logout --> [*] : Profile information removed from system

[*] --> [*] : System reset
@enduml
